# Place runnable applications here (one folder per app):
#
#   apps/
#   ├── api/      — backend service
#   ├── web/      — frontend SPA
#   └── worker/   — async job processor
#
# Each app:
#   - has its own package.json (npm name: @resume/<app>)
#   - extends ../../tsconfig.base.json
#   - has its own Dockerfile (multistage; targets dev, prod)
#   - is in the pnpm workspace via pnpm-workspace.yaml
#
# Delete this .gitkeep when the folder has real content.
